[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9734.55, "timestamp": "02:42:14", "text": "はい、車があります。 わかりました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9744.23, "timestamp": "02:42:24", "text": "。 えっと、広告はどこですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9746.95, "timestamp": "02:42:26", "text": "広告が戻るまで待ちます。 広告は終わりましたので、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9750.687, "timestamp": "02:42:30", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you could have played with me. i was trying to ride the matriach yesterday"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9754.71, "timestamp": "02:42:34", "text": "、そうしようとしていました。 はい、読みました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9757.51, "timestamp": "02:42:37", "text": "。 それを読んだよ。   わかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9759.75, "timestamp": "02:42:39", "text": "。 そうですね、18日の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9765.27, "timestamp": "02:42:45", "text": "ネット試験が終わった後にファイナンスの授業に参加するつもりだと言っていました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9767.75, "timestamp": "02:42:47", "text": "。 ああ、そうだ、私の試験は1月"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9772.79, "timestamp": "02:42:52", "text": "18日で、[音楽]はQ4にはないんだ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9773.625, "timestamp": "02:42:53", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oh i thought its got censored or something lol"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9775.99, "timestamp": "02:42:55", "text": "昨日、私は何をしましたか?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9779.51, "timestamp": "02:42:59", "text": "財務については、基本的な"}]